{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e7c9b591-fc5d-8423-9420-9459fe0a9170",
  "created_at": "2026-02-06T10:31:55-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nelson Cabral",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:29:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:29:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Morning. This is Nelson Cabral. The plow knocked over my mailbox."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:29:56-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I'm sorry to hear that, Mr. Cabral. When did this happen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:30:01-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Overnight. We got a dusting. Not even much. The plow came through and the mailbox is flat. Post and all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:30:08-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So the post is down, and the box is with it. Is it lying out by the street, or did it get pushed onto your lawn?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:30:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "By the curb. In the snowbank. I pulled it out so nobody trips."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:30:22-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, that's smart. And can I get the address where it happened?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:30:27-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd rather not give it over the cell. I'll leave my number. You can call me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:30:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. I can take a callback number and put your name with the report. What's the number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:30:40-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0187."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:30:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me read that back. 401-555-0187. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:30:45-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:30:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. And it sounds like it's pretty cold out there. Are you home?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:30:52-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. I'm at the bus stop. I take the bus. I'm standing here in the cold. It's about fifteen degrees. My hands are numb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:31:00-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh no, I'm sorry. I won't keep you long, then. So, the plow struck the mailbox and post, they're down at the curb, and you'd like to know when it'll be dealt with."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:31:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. When will it be fixed? I want to know when."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:31:15-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't give you a day right now. I'll send this to the crew supervisor who handles plow damage, and someone will call you at that number. Usually they look at it and tell you what happens next."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:31:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "How long does that take?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:31:31-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Could be a few days, especially with the cold and the crews out. I'll mark that you'd like a call as soon as possible."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:31:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. I've got mail coming. I don't want it blowing around."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:31:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. If you can, keep the box somewhere dry for now. And Mr. Cabral, I hope your bus comes soon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:31:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There it is now. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T10:31:53-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Goodbye, take care."
    }
  ],
